    "Chitter listens to whatever your Mac plays — Zoom, Meet, YouTube — so no bot has to join. Audio is processed on this Mac. macOS will ask for “System Audio Recording” permission.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chitter listens to whatever your Mac plays — Zoom, Meet, YouTube — so no bot has to join. Audio is processed on this Mac. macOS will ask for “System Audio Recording” permission."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Chitter listens to whatever your Mac plays — Zoom, Meet, YouTube — so no bot has to join. Audio is processed on this Mac. macOS will ask for “System Audio Recording” permission."
